Falsifies `inter_process_communication::notification::verification::a_wait_returns_a_nonzero_word_or_blocks`.

The defect: `WAIT` reads the word and forgets to clear it, so the same bits are delivered again
on every later wait. A copy where a take was meant.

Expected to fail: `assert_eq!(n.word, 0)` after `Wait::Word`.

diff --git a/crates/inter_process_communication/src/notification.rs b/crates/inter_process_communication/src/notification.rs
